0..69 Comment "// What function extensionality from univalence does not reach yet: a"
70..146 Comment "// homotopy read as a map into the path space, its two ends read back as the"
147..222 Comment "// two functions. The map holds the results of `f`, `g` and `h` at a point,"
223..301 Comment "// and an end reads one of them, so the end is `f` only where conversion reads"
302..373 Comment "// a call\'s result returned as the call itself, a step it does not take"
374..446 Comment "// (#1481). `../../model/identity/funext-from-ua.gandr` derives the path"
447..509 Comment "// between the ends; the drop of an unread call it needs is in"
510..552 Comment "// `../../model/control/divergence.gandr`."
554..602 Comment "// The path space, its ends and `funextOfSpace`."
